AI Ethics Interactive Textbook uses separate licenses for separate classes of work.

1. Original textbook prose in content/chapters/**/chapter.md and original
   project artwork are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
   International (CC BY 4.0), except where an item-level rights record states
   otherwise.

2. Software, including src/, scripts/, workers/, tests, configuration, and
   GitHub workflow code, is licensed under the MIT License.

3. Original structured metadata in JSON, YAML, and equivalent records is
   dedicated under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal, except where the record
   identifies third-party content or another license.

4. Third-party excerpts, translations, images, and other media retain the
   rights stated in their item-level records. Nothing in this repository-level
   notice relicenses those works.

The applicable notices are in LICENSES/. The machine-readable rights registry
is content/rights/registry.json.
